    "topic": "ALB subnet for a new Availability Zone",
    "stem": "<p>An ecommerce website runs on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB). A CloudOps engineer is extending the Auto Scaling group to span one more Availability Zone. EC2 instances in the new Availability Zone are in the running state but fail to register with the target group.</p>\n<p>How can the CloudOps engineer resolve this issue?</p>",
