    "why": "<p>The <code>iam:PermissionsBoundary</code> condition key is only evaluated for a specific set of IAM actions: <code>CreateUser</code>, <code>CreateRole</code>, the put/delete permissions boundary actions, and the attach/detach/put/delete policy actions for users and roles. <code>iam:UpdateAssumeRolePolicy</code> is not one of them, so the key is absent from the request context, the <code>StringEquals</code> condition never matches, and the Allow does not apply. The result is an implicit deny and the 403.</p>",
